  "description": "Single storey front extensions and single and two storey side to rear extensions; landscaping (Demolition of front porch and attached garage)",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;The proposed development\r\nis located within surface water flood zone 3a (medium) and 3b (high). &amp;nbsp;In\r\nthe absence of a satisfactory Flood Risk Assessment, it has not been\r\ndemonstrated that the proposed development would not exacerbate the risk of\r\nflooding within the site or increase the risk and consequences of flooding\r\nelsewhere, contrary to National Planning Policy Framework (2024),\r\nPolicy&amp;nbsp;SI 12 of The London Plan (2021), Core Policy CS1.U of the Harrow\r\nCore Strategy (2012) and Policies DM9 and DM10 of the Harrow Development\r\nManagement Policies Local Plan (2013) and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;CN3 and CN4 of the Draft Harrow Local Plan 2021-2041.&lt;/p&gt;"
